      "writtenOn": "2025-11-26T12:34:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another reason for having a host-command here is that we can\u0027t be sure that the charging applet will always charge to a 100%, so whenever its determined that the charging is done, we cache that SoC and wait for discharge.",
